  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Owner Dmitry Nagiyev gathers the restaurant staff and admits he went too far with his strict cost-cutting measures. He announces that someone experienced will now run the restaurant: his wife Kristina. Let's listen to the scene in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Ну что, мы приехали?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "kostya",
   "t": "Пошли узнаем, как у нас дела.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Ребята, в последние дни я перегибал палку.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "kostya",
   "t": "Дима, ну мы всё понимаем.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Это твой ресторан, душа болит.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Дома я посидел и хорошо подумал.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Мы с Кристиной посоветовались.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Рестораном должен управлять знающий человек.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Ну да, это совершенно правильно.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Этот человек сейчас среди нас.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "kostya",
   "t": "Дима, я всегда готов помочь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Это моя жена Кристина.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's walk through the Dmitry Nagiyev's announcement line by line.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Ну что, мы приехали?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Well, have we arrived?' Nagiyev steps out of his car outside the restaurant.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "kostya",
   "t": "Пошли узнаем, как у нас дела.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Let us go see how things are going.' He heads inside to address the team.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Ребята, в последние дни я перегибал палку.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Guys, these past few days I went too far.' The Russian idiom 'bent the stick' means to go overboard.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "kostya",
   "t": "Дима, ну мы всё понимаем.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Dima, well, we understand everything.' Right then, Chef Viktor warmly accepts his boss's apology.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Это твой ресторан, душа болит.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'It is your restaurant, your heart aches for it.' Literally 'the soul hurts', a warm everyday expression of care.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Дома я посидел и хорошо подумал.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'At home I sat down and thought it over.' Nagiyev explains that he reflected on the problem at home.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Мы с Кристиной посоветовались.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Kristina and I talked it over.' Right then, Viktor's secret phone call to Kristina clearly worked.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Рестораном должен управлять знающий человек.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The restaurant should be run by a knowledgeable person.' Nagiyev agrees that a professional is needed.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Ну да, это совершенно правильно.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Well yes, that is completely right.' In this moment, Chef Viktor nods eagerly, expecting to be put back in charge.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "Этот человек сейчас среди нас.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'That person is right here among us.' Nagiyev builds suspense in front of the staff.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "kostya",
   "t": "Дима, я всегда готов помочь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Dima, I am always ready to help.' In response, Viktor steps forward to accept the role.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Это моя жена Кристина.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
